  "severity": "Low",
  "description": "PHP is an HTML-embedded scripting language commonly used with the Apache HTTP Server.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* php: PHP OpenSSL extension: Denial of Service due to buffer allocation flaw in AES-WRAP-PAD (CVE-2026-14355)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Rebase PHP to 8.3.32 for CVE-2026-14355 CVE-2026-12184 in 10.2.z (JIRA:Rocky Linux-192618)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
